  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Middle East Partnership for Peace Act (MEPPA) - Next Generation Accelerator .</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Next Generation Accelerator initiative creates a generation of leaders with the skills, motivation, and networks to build an entrepreneurial community committed to shaping a peaceful Israeli-Palestinian future from the ground up. Based on the premise that an interconnected human and economic infrastructure is essential to support a lasting peace, the Next Generation Accelerator uses entrepreneurship as a vehicle to attract young Israelis and Palestinians and support their development as leaders within a startup ecosystem across the West Bank, Gaza, and Israel.</narrative>
  </description>
